WEBVTT

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:01.997
[What strategies can help people change
their shame into guilt and move on?]

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:05.463
I think that just knowing
the difference between the two

00:05:05.497 --> 00:05:08.863
is sometimes an aha
experience for people,

00:05:08.863 --> 00:05:11.897
if you can identify when
you feel shame and sort of

00:05:12.997 --> 00:05:14.830
do some double-checking, you know,

00:05:14.863 --> 00:05:17.763
"Is it really fair for me
to feel like a bad person

00:05:17.797 --> 00:05:22.163
because I lost my temper
with my kids today?

00:05:22.197 --> 00:05:24.563
Does that mean I'm a horrible parent?

00:05:24.597 --> 00:05:26.163
Or am I generally a good parent,

00:05:26.197 --> 00:05:27.363
but this was a bad day,

00:05:27.363 --> 00:05:33.097
and I did a bad thing
and let me address that